:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy unit, see [[ALLEN O'NEIL (Enemy)]].''
'''ALLEN O'NEIL''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 4.3 Update|Version 4.3]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Metal Slug Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 220
|rarity = SR
|name1 = ALLEN O'NEIL
|name2 = ALLEN O'NEIL CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''ALLEN O'NEIL CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
ALLEN O'NEIL is essentially a slightly better version of [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]], which is great considering that the main strategy with Dragon Cat and its variants is to stack as many as possible. Sadly, although he does look promising with his [[Survive|Survive]] ability, his damage is half the damage of other Dragon Cat variants, meaning that he should be replaced with [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Dragon Cat]] or [[Brainwashed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed Dragon Cat]] once either are obtained.

{{Job|Classification = Backliner}}

