==Trivia==
*ALLEN O'NEIL is based off of [[wikia:metalslug:Allen O'Neil|Allen O'Neil]] from the Metal Slug series.
*ALLEN O'NEIL's Normal and Evolved Form descriptions originally began with "Recruited from Metal Slug Defense!". They were changed in [[Version 13.1 Update|Ver. 13.1]] of [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] and [[Version 13.7 Update|Ver. 13.7]] for all other versions to reflect the fact that ''Metal Slug Defense'' was no longer the specific game in the series that was being collaborated with.
*ALLEN O'NEIL's survive ability is a reference to him reappearing in most ''Metal Slug'' games despite dying in every battle.

